    "Is there a limit on how many units can be sold in any given month (for example, a demand cap), or can I sell any non-negative quantity up to whatever is available in inventory?"
  ],
  "rationale": "The response asks a single clarification question regarding the upper bound of monthly sales, framed as a choice between a demand cap and inventory availability."
}

